OL,3,GNEWSAFurther education colleges cut
OL,4,Athousands of student places amid budget
OL,5,Aabsence
OL,6,
OL,7,FFurther Education colleges across
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland plan to cut almost
OL,9,F8,000 student enrolments for the
OL,10,F2026/27 academic year, Stormont's
OL,11,Feconomy committee has heard.
OL,13,FThis is almost double the original
OL,14,Ffigure of 4,000 they had planned to
OL,15,Fcut.
OL,17,FIn a statement, a Belfast Metropolitan
OL,18,FCollege (BMC) spokesperson said that
OL,19,Fthe deadlock over a Stormont budget was
OL,20,Fpartially responsible.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
